 "text": "Hello there! How's your day treating you? Of course! How old are the kids? Great. Peelable tents are perfect for small kids. Do you want plan a single day, or let them lead with choices of food and games? Lovely. Stickers are great for little ones, but a coloring book is bigger juice for their energy. A treasure hunt is always a hit, or a game of catch if you have a big space. A big blanket in the shade is enough. Yes, and a small pot of water in case they get cold. And snacks, always important for small eaters.",
